  "body": "Fixes #13205.\n\nWhen a `Document` is destroyed (in both \"destroy a child navigable\" for same-agent descendant documents and \"destroy a document\"), mark it as destroyed and run the document destroyed steps for each active streaming HTML parser whose fragment context document is that `Document`, erroring its `WritableStream` with an `\"InvalidStateError\"` `DOMException` and aborting the fragment parser. Starting a stream on an element whose node document is already destroyed likewise immediately errors the stream with `\"InvalidStateError\"`.\n\nTests: https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/64923\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programmatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/13217/document-lifecycle.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 9, 2026, 5:02 PM UTC (74d006d)\">/document-lifecycle.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/13217/5fcc231...74d006d/document-lifecycle.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 9, 2026, 5:02 PM UTC (74d006d)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/13217/document-sequences.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 9, 2026, 5:02 PM UTC (74d006d)\">/document-sequences.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/13217/5fcc231...74d006d/document-sequences.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 9, 2026, 5:02 PM UTC (74d006d)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/13217/dom.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 9, 2026, 5:02 PM UTC (74d006d)\">/dom.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/13217/5fcc231...74d006d/dom.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 9, 2026, 5:02 PM UTC (74d006d)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/13217/dynamic-markup-insertion.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 9, 2026, 5:02 PM UTC (74d006d)\">/dynamic-markup-insertion.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/13217/5fcc231...74d006d/dynamic-markup-insertion.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 9, 2026, 5:02 PM UTC (74d006d)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/13217/parsing.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 9, 2026, 5:02 PM UTC (74d006d)\">/parsing.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/13217/5fcc231...74d006d/parsing.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 9, 2026, 5:02 PM UTC (74d006d)\">diff</a> )",
